id: event_system_supervisor_mode
package: platform_core
label: Event System Supervisor Mode
description: The Supervisor Mode feature provides APIs that can be used to access events from an internal queue which subscribes to all events published across all event classes. Users can optionally publish IRQ events to this queue, as well as decode IRQ events retrieved from the queue. This centralized event handling mechanism simplifies monitoring and processing of system-wide events.
category: Platform|Utilities
quality: production
